status GREEN -- shim_reason, tool_path_repoint, tool_path, docs_command_path, mantra_annotate_cli, reds_monotone, reds_ledger_headline, reds_row_present, reds_pin_capacity and card_pin_claim all green by name. The re-verify pass after the rebase read 258 green, 1 red: standing_equipment reading red_self behind dated_path, whose own red was recorded 20260910.232156 and is %626, OPEN on Keaton's word. Nothing of this lap's stands red.
recommend keep-going -- the same slice can take the next ten cadence guards, and the run card carries the order
